WEBVTT

00:35:01.333 --> 00:35:04.309
Next time, on WorkLife, at your request,

00:35:04.333 --> 00:35:08.393
a bonus episode with the always
provocative therapist and podcast host,

00:35:08.417 --> 00:35:09.684
Esther Perel.

00:35:09.708 --> 00:35:13.268
Esther Perel: There is no relationship
that doesn't have a power dimension.

00:35:13.292 --> 00:35:16.184
AG: Who do you think has more power
in our relationship here?

00:35:16.208 --> 00:35:18.184
EP: At this moment, it alternates.

00:35:18.208 --> 00:35:19.518
AG: Relationships at work.

00:35:19.542 --> 00:35:24.625
Power, trust, and how to avoid the curse
of being a people-pleaser.

00:35:29.125 --> 00:35:31.268
WorkLife is hosted by me, Adam Grant.